Package: libical3
Version: @DEB_LIBICAL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://libical.github.io/libical/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libxml2, libicu74
Description: iCalendar parser library - runtime
 libical parses, generates and operates on the iCalendar formats (RFC 5545
 and friends). This package bundles the libical, libicalss, libicalvcal and
 libical-glib shared libraries; evolution-data-server is the main consumer.
 Timezone rules come from the system zoneinfo database.
